# v0.4 adds consistent dark WPF settings menus, Diagnostics styling, themed tray menu and expanded UI preview checks. It also carries private v0.3 monitoring, Bluetooth cache, input freshness and guarded disconnect improvements.
# Public Windows CI passed 85 automated tests, WPF smoke and ZIP verification. This is an unsigned prerelease; the new UI and guarded disconnect still require physical acceptance.
# Native lightbar hardware behavior, DS4Windows RGB ownership/restoration, Fn+Square and idle disconnect remain unverified or incomplete; native lighting defaults off.
